  "notes": "COMPOUNDS:\nどこ (where) + でも (even, any)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\nThe ~でも pattern creates \"any-\" words:\n- {誰|だれ}でも - anyone\n- {何|なん}でも - anything\n- いつでも - anytime\n- どちらでも - either one\n\nPOPULAR CULTURE:\nドラえもん's iconic gadget is called どこでもドア (Anywhere Door) - a door that can transport you anywhere.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- どこでも (anywhere) ↔ どこか (somewhere)\n- どこでも (anywhere) ↔ どこも + neg (nowhere)\n- どこでも (anywhere) ↔ どこにも + neg (to nowhere)",
